    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d463">

                <pb facs="0546" n="458" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg458"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1014: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-06T15:00:00-05:00">February 6, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>20. Reference White’s telephone conversation Thurston this morning.<anchor n="97"
                        xml:id="d463-f1"/> Telegram just received from Bogotá indicates change in
                    situation and that President Olaya withdraws his acceptance of proposal
                    mentioned.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
